 components/script/dom/event/event.rs                      | 4 +++-
 .../meta/IndexedDB/request_bubble-and-capture.any.js.ini  | 8 --------
 .../IndexedDB/transaction-abort-request-error.any.js.ini  | 8 --------
 .../IndexedDB/transaction_bubble-and-capture.any.js.ini   | 8 --------
